WEBVTT

1
00:00.250 --> 00:03.150
Save the place. Keep the context.

2
00:03.150 --> 00:07.000
In Map Nero, choose a visible, writable layer.

3
00:07.000 --> 00:10.900
Tap Add Pin, name the point, and save it.

4
00:10.900 --> 00:16.150
Open the saved point and add your field note in Information.

5
00:16.150 --> 00:20.100
Close the card, then reopen it to check the details.

6
00:20.100 --> 00:24.000
Tap Show to bring the point back onto the map.

7
00:24.000 --> 00:28.000
Try this with practice data before fieldwork.

8
00:28.000 --> 00:31.500
Map Nero. One map. Many ways.
